From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:13:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Headset page: grey out refresh rates the headset does not
 offer

Reads the headset display's EDID and disables the rates it does not list;
without a visible headset only the default can be chosen. The subtitle
lists the rates the headset offers.
